Project Design Phase Phase
LegalEase: AI-Powered Legal Document Generator

Project Design Phase

1. Introduction

The Project Design Phase converts the requirements identified in the Requirement Analysis Phase into a detailed technical design.

For LegalEase, the design focuses on creating a simple, user-friendly, and secure web application that allows users to select a document type, enter relevant information, generate an AI-assisted legal document draft, review it, edit it, and download the final draft.

> LegalEase is designed for AI-assisted document drafting, not as a replacement for professional legal advice.




---

2. Design Objectives

The main objectives of the design are:

Create a simple and attractive user interface.

Make document generation easy for non-technical users.

Connect the application with an AI service.

Organize user information systematically.

Generate structured document drafts.

Provide document preview and editing.

Support document downloading.

Protect user information and API credentials.

Make the application easy to maintain and expand.



