5. Backend Design

The backend manages the application's main processing.

Possible technology

Python + Flask

The backend will:

1. Receive user input.


2. Validate the input.


3. Identify the document type.


4. Create an AI prompt.


5. Send the request to the AI service.


6. Receive the generated draft.


7. Return the result to the frontend.


8. Generate downloadable files.




