7. Prompt Design

A structured prompt can be used to obtain consistent results.

Example concept

Document Type:
Rental Agreement

User Information:
Owner: ______
Tenant: ______
Property: ______
Rent: ______
Duration: ______

Instructions:
Create a clearly structured draft using only the
information provided. Do not invent important facts.
Clearly identify missing information where necessary.

This approach helps the AI generate more consistent drafts.


