12. Security Design

Security is important because users may provide personal information.

The system should:

Store API keys in environment variables.

Never expose API keys in JavaScript/frontend code.

Validate user input.

Use HTTPS when deployed.

Avoid unnecessary storage of sensitive information.

Restrict access to stored documents.

Provide appropriate privacy information.



