18. Design Considerations

During the design phase, the following points should be considered:

AI-generated content must be reviewable.

Missing information should be clearly identified.

The system should not fabricate legal facts.

Different document types require different input fields.

User data should be handled securely.

The application should remain simple enough for beginners.

The architecture should allow additional AI/document features later.



