20. Conclusion

The Project Design Phase provides the technical blueprint for LegalEase: AI-Powered Legal Document Generator. It defines how the frontend, backend, AI service, database, and document-generation modules will communicate with each other.

The final design follows a simple process:

Select Document → Enter Details → Validate → AI Generation → Review/Edit → Download

This design provides the foundation for the next stage, the Project Development Phase, where the actual LegalEase application will be implemented.
